window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They thought the apocalypse was over—turns out, it was just beginning.</b></p> <p>As ancient witch-vampire hybrid <i>Tabitha Cordova</i> returns from the grave, a sinister plan unfolds. With one bite, her creations evolve—becoming stronger, smarter, and nearly unstoppable. Claws grow, wings unfurl, and the sky darkens with the rise of a new dominant species.</p> <p>Now hunted and betrayed, Bree is caught in a deadly game of survival where enemies wear familiar faces and the truth is more dangerous than the monsters. With time running out and the world on the brink, she must uncover the secrets of her bloodline and stop the ascension—before humanity is erased.</p> <p><b>Hybrids are coming. And they’re not here to share the world…they’re here to claim it.</b></p>"; 
